def flatDeficit (c : E) (v : E) (σ : ℝ) : ℝ :=
  Real.sqrt σ * ⟪v, v⟫ - 2 * ⟪c, v⟫ + ⟪c, c⟫ / Real.sqrt σ
```
Then use `flatDeficit c (P.velocity σ) σ`. Pointwise lemma:
```
theorem flatDeficit_eq_normSq {c v : E} {σ} (hσ : 0 < σ) :
    flatDeficit c v σ = Real.sqrt σ * ‖v - (1 / Real.sqrt σ) • c‖ ^ 2 := by
  unfold flatDeficit
  rw [← real_inner_self_eq_norm_sq]
  simp only [inner_sub_left, inner_sub_right, real_inner_smul_right, real_inner_smul_left, real_inner_comm v c]
  field_simp [ne_of_gt (Real.sqrt_pos.2 hσ)]
  ring
```
And `flatDeficit_nonneg (hσ : 0 < σ) : 0 ≤ flatDeficit c v σ := by rw [flatDeficit_eq_normSq hσ]; exact mul_nonneg (Real.sqrt_nonneg σ) real_inner_self_nonneg`.

