```
theorem reducedVolumeIntegrandUnnormalized_eq_gaussianKernel {τ : ℝ} (hτ : 0 < τ) (x) :
    reducedVolumeIntegrandUnnormalized n τ x = (4 * π) ^ ((n : ℝ) / 2) * gaussianKernel n τ x := by
  unfold reducedVolumeIntegrandUnnormalized gaussianKernel
  rw [heatKernelReducedDistance_eq hτ]  -- hmm — need to be careful: heatKernelReducedDistance_eq hτ : heatKernelReducedDistance n τ x = ‖x‖²/(4τ) — rewrite inside exp(-...) ✓
  rw [show -(‖x‖ ^ 2 / (4 * τ)) = -‖x‖ ^ 2 / (4 * τ) by ring]
  -- goal: τ ^ (-n/2) * exp (-‖x‖²/(4τ)) = (4π)^(n/2) * ((4πτ)^(-n/2) * exp(-‖x‖²/(4τ)))
  have hbase : 0 < 4 * π := by positivity
  have hcoef : τ ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) = (4 * π) ^ ((n : ℝ) / 2) * (4 * π * τ) ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
    have hmul : (4 * π * τ) ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) = (4 * π) ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) * τ ^ (-(n : ℝ) / 2) := by
      exact Real.mul_rpow (le_of_lt hbase) hτ.le
    -- need: τ^(-n/2) = (4π)^(n/2) * (4π)^(-n/2) * τ^(-n/2)
    rw [hmul] -- goal: τ^(-n/2) = (4π)^(n/2) * ((4π)^(-n/2) * τ^(-n/2))
    rw [← mul_assoc, ← Real.rpow_add hbase, show (n:ℝ)/2 + (-(n:ℝ)/2) = 0 by ring, Real.rpow_zero, one_mul]
  rw [hcoef]
  ring
```
Hmm — let me structure: goal after the two rws: τ^(-n/2) * e = (4π)^(n/2) * ((4πτ)^(-n/2) * e) where e = exp(...). Use rw [hcoef] — rewrites τ^(-n/2) → (4π)^(n/2) * (4πτ)^(-n/2): goal (4π)^(n/2) * (4πτ)^(-n/2) * e = (4π)^(n/2) * ((4πτ)^(-n/2) * e) — hmm: LHS is ((4π)^(n/2) * (4πτ)^(-n/2)) * e, RHS (4π)^(n/2) * ((4πτ)^(-n/2) * e) — mul_assoc: LHS = (4π)^(n/2) * ((4πτ)^(-n/2) * e) ✓ — ring closes.

Careful with hmul direction: Real.mul_rpow (hx : 0 ≤ x) (hy : 0 ≤ y) : (x * y) ^ z = x ^ z * y ^ z — with x = 4π, y = τ, z = -n/2: (4π·τ)^(-n/2) = (4π)^(-n/2) · τ^(-n/2) ✓.

