computation instantiates the interface (`euclideanManifoldReducedVolumeInterface`) and proves
the theorem unconditionally (`euclidean_manifoldReducedVolumeMonotonicity`), with equality:
the reduced volume is constant `1`. -/
def ReducedVolumeMonotonicityTheorem {E : Type*} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [InnerProductSpace ℝ E]
    (M : ManifoldReducedVolumeInterface E) : Prop :=
  ReducedVolumeMonotonicity M.reducedVolume
